  "qualification": [
    "W1, Air and Mini each passed 27 Direct + 12 Graph cases and two public-header checks on the first immutable candidate. No product or test correction followed compilation or device execution.",
    "W1/Air installed validation layers reported no Validation Error, VUID or SYNC-HAZARD. Mini is correctness/portability only and has no installed validation layer.",
    "Concat preserves raw F32/F16/BF16/I32/I64/Bool bits. Independent literal row concatenation covers 1/2/3/4/5/9 inputs, positive and negative axes, permuted odd-byte strides, rank-eight broadcast, repeated inputs, skipped empty groups, all-empty outputs and huge empty extents.",
    "Every group of at most three inputs writes only its final-output segments. Output words crossing rows have one writer per group; existing native compute barriers protect preserved earlier-group bits. No intermediate device buffer, memset, full-output scan per group or host payload evaluation is introduced.",
    "Fixed Recorder checks borrowed output guard bytes and rejects input/output alias. Ordinary Graph permutes five true input Views and concatenates them in two native dispatches with one output storage block. Widths 1/129/2048, odd native origins, two slots, changed bindings, retained old outputs and reading after close passed.",
    "Preparation freezes the native specialization and group boundaries. Execution does not search or time providers. Full-C1 actual-weight, three-delivery and fair P1 qualification has not run."
  ],
